{"info":{"id":"ses_e5ae6ffa9ffebmYu0M92PVLBvK","projectID":"fbd84a3934ed48428f6b35b5bb2502e461c30b40","model":{"id":"nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"cost":0,"tokens":{"input":20301,"output":10537,"reasoning":1143,"cache":{"read":21680,"write":0}},"outcome":"succeeded","time":{"created":1793771241889,"updated":1793771311905,"busy":1793771242007,"idle":1793771311907},"title":"Mountain village fishing game","location":{"directory":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround"}},"messages":[{"id":"msg_1a51901cd001tM1AM5lc7g5bRq","time":{"created":1793771242014},"text":"\"Buat game dimana game tersebut menampilkan orang yang sedang di kaki pegunungan dimana kita bisa ber interaksi seperti memancing atau melampar batu lalu ada sebuah rumah juga untuk istirahat dan beberapa orang lalu lalang dimana mereka punya profesi berbeda beda ada yang jual makanan ada yang jual minuman atau alat untuk digunung seperti alat pancing atau alat untuk memanjat tebing tenda dan sebagainya dan buat pegunungan nya mengitari sebuah danau dan ada aliran keluar seperti sungai dan pastikan banyak ikan disana yang bisa dijual\n\n---\nThis is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.\n\"","files":[],"type":"user"},{"id":"msg_1a519022a001NinTNWaXCHZyh4","time":{"created":1793771242030,"streamed":1793771301234,"completed":1793771301260},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"The user wants a game where:\n1. Shows a person on a mountain foot/hills (kaki pegunungan)\n2. Can interact like fishing (memancing) or throwing stones (melampar batu)\n3. Has a house for resting\n4. Several NPCs walking around with different professions - food seller, drink seller, mountain gear seller (fishing gear, climbing gear, tents, etc.)\n5. Mountains surround a lake\n6. Water outlet like a river\n7. Many fish that can be sold\n\nThis is in Indonesian. The response should be in Indonesian presumably, or English. Let me build this as a complete playable HTML5/JavaScript game in one file.\n\nLet me plan the game:\n- Canvas-based game (top-down or slight angle)\n- Player character on mountain foot\n- Mountains surrounding a lake\n- River flowing out\n- Fishing spots with fish\n- Stone throwing mechanic\n- House for resting (rest/sleep to regain energy)\n- NPCs with professions: food seller, drink seller, gear seller (fishing rod, climbing gear, tent)\n- Fish can be caught and sold\n- Economy: earn money from selling fish\n\nLet me create a complete single-file HTML game with Canvas.\n\nGame mechanics:\n- Arrow keys / WASD to move\n- Space to interact (fish, talk to NPC, enter house)\n- Fishing mini-game\n- Stone throwing (click to throw stone)\n- Inventory: fish, money, energy\n- Shop system\n- Day/night cycle maybe\n- Resting at house restores energy\n\nLet me build this. I'll write an index.html with embedded CSS and JS.\n\nKey features:\n- Player sprite (simple colored rectangle/circle)\n- Lake in center, mountains around\n- River outlet\n- Fish swimming in lake\n- Fishing spots\n- NPCs walking around with labels of profession\n- House building\n- UI: money, energy, inventory, instructions\n\nLet me write a complete, polished game. I'll keep it all in one file for simplicity.\n\nLet me write the code now.\n\nI'll structure:\n- Canvas rendering\n- Game state: player, npcs, fish, items, shops, house\n- Input handling\n- Update loop\n- Render loop\n- UI overlays (shop dialog, fishing mini-game, rest dialog)\n\nLet me write it in Indonesian language for the game text since the request is in Indonesian.\n\nLet me create the file.\n\nI need to be thorough but the game should be playable. Let me write it carefully.\n\nLet me think about the world layout:\n- Canvas 1000x700\n- Lake: circle/ellipse in center\n- Mountains: triangles around the lake\n- River: from lake flowing out bottom-right\n- House: bottom-left area\n- NPCs: walk around shore\n- Fish: swim in lake\n- Player: starts near house/shore\n\nInteractions:\n- Near fishing spot + press F: fishing mini-game\n- Near stone pile + click/press: throw stone\n- Near house + press E: rest (sleep, restore energy, time passes)\n- Near NPC + press E: talk/shop\n\nEconomy:\n- Catch fish -> sell to food seller or general\n- Money used to buy food, drinks, gear\n\nLet me code this up. I'll make it robust and complete.\n\nI'll write the full HTML file now.","native":{"reasoningField":"reasoning_content"},"time":{"created":1793771243397,"completed":1793771301229}},{"type":"text","text":"Saya akan membuat sebuah game HTML5 (Canvas) lengkap dalam satu file yang bisa langsung dimainkan di browser. Game ini akan berjudul **\"Pemandian Gunung Danau\"**.\n\nMari saya buat file game-nya.\n"},{"type":"tool","id":"call-db2ca881-0bb4-4d67-88a4-827e09723b7a","name":"write","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/game-gunung-danau.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pemandian Gunung Danau</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    background: #1a1a2e;\n    color: #e0e0e0;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    height: 100vh;\n  }\n  #game-container {\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n    border: 4px solid #3a3a5c;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    background: #87ceeb;\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    max-height: 90vh;\n  }\n  canvas {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n  }\n  #ui {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 12px; left: 12px; right: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .stat-panel {\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);\n    border: 2px solid #555;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    min-width: 170px;\n    pointer-events: auto;\n  }\n  .stat-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px; }\n  .stat-label { color: #cfcfdf; }\n  .stat-value { color: #fff; font-weight: bold; font-family: monospace; }\n  .money { color: #ffd700; }\n  .energy { color: #7cfc00; }\n  .fish { color: #00bfff; }\n  .item { color: #ff9800; }\n\n  #overlay {\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center; z-index: 20; pointer-events: auto;\n  }\n  #overlay.visible { display: flex; }\n  .panel {\n    background: #2a2a3e; border: 3px solid #ffd700; border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 22px 30px; min-width: 300px; text-align: center;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255,215,0,0.25);\n  }\n  .panel h2 { color: #ffd700; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 24px; }\n  .panel p { margin: 8px 0; color: #ddd; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .btn-row { margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  button {\n    background: #4a4a6a; color: #fff; border: 2px solid #7c7ca0;\n    border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 18px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.15s;\n  }\n  button:hover { background: #6a6a9a; border-color: #ffd700; }\n  button.primary { background: #1e90ff; border-color: #4da6ff; }\n  button.primary:hover { background: #4da6ff; }\n  button.danger { background: #d32f2f; border-color: #ff5252; }\n  button.danger:hover { background: #ff5252; }\n\n  #hint {\n    position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 14px; color: #fff; pointer-events: none; z-index: 10;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.4);\n  }\n  #msg {\n    position: absolute; top: 60px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: rgba(20,20,30,0.85); color: #fff; padding: 8px 16px;\n    border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; pointer-events: none; z-index: 10;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.3); display: none;\n  }\n  .controls { position: absolute; bottom: 12px; right: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; pointer-events: none; text-align: right; line-height: 1.4; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div id=\"game-container\">\n  <canvas id=\"game\" width=\"1100\" height=\"700\"></canvas>\n\n  <div id=\"ui\">\n    <div class=\"stat-panel\">\n      <div class=\"stat-row\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Uang</span><span class=\"stat-value money\" id=\"ui-money\">Rp 0</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Ikan</span><span class=\"stat-value fish\" id=\"ui-fish\">0</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Energi</span><span class=\"stat-value energy\" id=\"ui-energy\">100%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Tas</span><span class=\"stat-value item\" id=\"ui-items\">-</span></div>\n      <div class=\"stat-row\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Waktu</span><span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"ui-time\">Pagi</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-panel\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\n      <div style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;\">PETUNJUK</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#ddd;\">\n        WASD / Panah: Gerak<br>\n        E: Interaksi / Bicara / Istirahat<br>\n        F: Memancing<br>\n        Klik: Lempar Batu<br>\n        Esc: Tutup menu\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"hint\">Arahkan ke objek dan tekan <b>E</b> / <b>F</b> untuk berinteraksi</div>\n  <div id=\"msg\"></div>\n\n  <div id=\"overlay\">\n    <div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\">\n      <h2 id=\"panel-title\">Menu</h2>\n      <div id=\"panel-content\"></div>\n      <div class=\"btn-row\" id=\"panel-btns\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    Pemandian Gunung Danau &middot; Kaki Pegunungan &bull; Danau &bull; Sungai &bull; Ikan\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n/* ============================ KONFIGURASI ============================ */\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('game');\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\nconst W = canvas.width, H = canvas.height;\n\nconst TILE = 40;\nconst FPS = 60;\n\nlet money = 50000;\nlet fishCount = 0;\nlet energy = 100;\nlet inventory = []; // daftar item string\nlet timeOfDay = 'Pagi'; // Pagi, Siang, Sore, Malam\nlet timeMinutes = 360; // 06:00\n\n/* ============================ STATUS UI ============================ */\nfunction updateUI(){\n  document.getElementById('ui-money').textContent = 'Rp ' + money.toLocaleString('id-ID');\n  document.getElementById('ui-fish').textContent = fishCount;\n  document.getElementById('ui-energy').textContent = energy + '%';\n  document.getElementById('ui-items').textContent = inventory.length ? inventory.join(', ') : '-';\n  document.getElementById('ui-time').textContent = timeOfDay;\n}\nfunction showMsg(text, ms=2200){\n  const el = document.getElementById('msg');\n  el.textContent = text; el.style.display = 'block';\n  setTimeout(()=>{ el.style.display='none'; }, ms);\n}\n\n/* ============================ ASET / GAMBAR ============================ */\n// Buat semua gambar secara prosedural dengan canvas offscreen agar tidak butuh file eksternal\nconst off = document.createElement('canvas'); off.width=64; off.height=64;\nconst octx = off.getContext('2d');\n\nfunction drawCircle(cx,cy,r,color,stroke){ octx.clearRect(0,0,64,64); octx.fillStyle=color; octx.beginPath(); octx.arc(cx,cy,r,0,Math.PI*2); octx.fill(); if(stroke){octx.strokeStyle=stroke;octx.lineWidth=2;octx.stroke();} return off; }\nfunction rectImg(w,h,color){ const c=document.createElement('canvas'); c.width=w;c.height=h; const x=c.getContext('2d'); x.fillStyle=color; x.fillRect(0,0,w,h); return c; }\nfunction tintImg(img,color){ const c=document.createElement('canvas'); c.width=img.width;c.height=img.height; const x=c.getContext('2d'); x.globalCompositeOperation='source-over'; x.drawImage(img,0,0); x.globalCompositeOperation='source-atop'; x.fillStyle=color; x.fillRect(0,0,img.width,img.height); x.globalCompositeOperation='destination-atop'; x.drawImage(img,0,0); x.globalCompositeOperation='source-over'; return c; }\n\nconst IMG = {};\nIMG.player = drawCircle(32,32,16,'#e74c3c','#c0392b'); // pemain merah\nIMG.npc = drawCircle(32,32,16,'#3498db','#2980b9');\nIMG.npcFood = drawCircle(32,32,16,'#e67e22','#d35400');\nIMG.npcDrink = drawCircle(32,32,16,'#9b59b6','#8e44ad');\nIMG.npcGear = drawCircle(32,32,16,'#2ecc71','#27ae60');\nIMG.fish = drawCircle(32,32,10,'#1abc9c','#16a085');\nIMG.stone = drawCircle(32,32,8,'#95a5a6','#7f8c8d');\nIMG.hook = drawCircle(32,32,4,'#f1c40f','#f39c12');\n\n// Rumah\nconst houseImg = document.createElement('canvas'); houseImg.width=120; houseImg.height=90;\nconst hx = houseImg.getContext('2d');\nhx.fillStyle='#8b4513'; hx.fillRect(20,50,80,40); // dinding\nhx.fillStyle='#a0522d'; hx.fillRect(40,50,40,40); // pintu\nhx.fillStyle='#b22222'; hx.beginPath(); hx.moveTo(10,50); hx.lineTo(60,10); hx.lineTo(110,50); hx.closePath(); hx.fill(); // atap\nhx.fillStyle='#ffd700'; hx.fillRect(46,52,6,26); // kramem pintu\nIMG.house = houseImg;\n\n// Pegunungan (segitiga)\nfunction mountainImg(w,h,color){\n  const c=document.createElement('canvas'); c.width=w;c.height=h; const x=c.getContext('2d');\n  x.fillStyle=color; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(w/2,0); x.lineTo(w,h); x.lineTo(0,h); x.closePath(); x.fill();\n  x.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.25)'; x.lineWidth=2; x.beginPath(); x.moveTo(w/2,0); x.lineTo(w/2*0.4,h*0.9); x.stroke();\n  return c;\n}\nIMG.mtn1 = mountainImg(220,160,'#5d4037');\nIMG.mtn2 = mountainImg(200,150,'#6d4c41');\nIMG.mtn3 = mountainImg(240,170,'#4e342e');\nIMG.snow = mountainImg(120,90,'#cfd8dc');\n\n// Sungai\nconst riverImg = document.createElement('canvas'); riverImg.width=200; riverImg.height=120;\nconst rx = riverImg.getContext('2d');\nconst grad = rx.createLinearGradient(0,0,200,120); grad.addColorStop(0,'#4a90e2'); grad.addColorStop(1,'#1e6fd0');\nrx.fillStyle=grad; rx.beginPath(); rx.moveTo(180,120); rx.bezierCurveTo(120,60,80,100,20,20); rx.lineTo(0,120); rx.closePath(); rx.fill();\nIMG.river = riverImg;\n\n// Danau\nconst lakeImg = document.createElement('canvas'); lakeImg.width=560; lakeImg.height=340;\nconst lx = lakeImg.getContext('2d');\nconst lg = lx.createRadialGradient(280,170,30,280,170,340); lg.addColorStop(0,'#5dade2'); lg.addColorStop(1,'#1f618d');\nlx.fillStyle=lg; lx.beginPath(); lx.ellipse(280,170,250,150,0,0,Math.PI*2); lx.fill();\nlx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.25)'; lx.lineWidth=3; lx.beginPath(); lx.ellipse(280,170,250,150,0,0,Math.PI*2); lx.stroke();\nIMG.lake = lakeImg;\n\n// Tenda (untuk NPC / dekorasi)\nconst tentImg = document.createElement('canvas'); tentImg.width=50; tentImg.height=40;\nconst tx = tentImg.getContext('2d');\ntx.fillStyle='#e74c3c'; tx.beginPath(); tx.moveTo(25,0); tx.lineTo(45,35); tx.lineTo(5,35); tx.closePath(); tx.fill();\ntx.fillStyle='#95a5a6'; tx.fillRect(20,35,10,5);\nIMG.tent = tentImg;\n\n/* ============================ ENTITAS ============================ */\nconst player = { x: 150, y: 520, w: 30, h: 30, dir: 'down', speed: 2.6, img: IMG.player };\nconst camera = { x: 0, y: 0 };\n\nconst npcs = [];\nfunction addNPC(x,y,profesi,nama,img){\n  npcs.push({ x, y, w:28, h:28, profesi, nama, img, vx:(Math.random()-0.5)*0.5, vy:(Math.random()-0.5)*0.5, dir:0, talkTimer:0, stock:[] });\n}\n// Profesi: makanan, minuman, peralatan\naddNPC(260, 560, 'makanan', 'Pak Ujang (Penjual Makanan)', IMG.npcFood);\naddNPC(760, 540, 'minuman', 'Bu Siti (Penjual Minuman)', IMG.npcDrink);\naddNPC(500, 120, 'peralatan', 'Pak Rizal (Toko Peralatan Gunung)', IMG.npcGear);\naddNPC(900, 300, 'pemandu', 'Mbak Lina (Pemandu Pendaki)', IMG.npc);\naddNPC(200, 300, 'petani', 'Bapak Joko (Petani Sayur)', IMG.npc);\n\n// Spot memancing di tepi danau\nconst fishingSpots = [\n  {x:300,y:330,r:26},{x:540,y:330,r:26},{x:720,y:300,r:26},\n  {x:420,y:40,r:26},{x:180,y:120,r:26},{x:900,y:160,r:26}\n];\n\n// Ikan di danau\nconst fishes = [];\nfunction spawnFish(){\n  for(let i=0;i<14;i++){\n    fishes.push({\n      x: 280 + (Math.random()-0.5)*460,\n      y: 170 + (Math.random()-0.5)*260,\n      vx: (Math.random()-0.5)*1.2,\n      vy: (Math.random()-0.5)*1.2,\n      r: 7,\n      color: '#'+Math.floor(Math.random()*0xffffff).toString(16).padStart(6,'0'),\n      caught: false\n    });\n  }\n}\nspawnFish();\n\n// Batu yang bisa dilempar (di tepi danau)\nconst stonePiles = [\n  {x:380,y:345,r:18},{x:620,y:315,r:18},{x:220,y:140,r:18}\n];\n\n// Rumah\nconst house = { x: 130, y: 500, w: 120, h: 90, img: IMG.house };\n\n// Tenda dekorasi di sekitar\nconst tents = [\n  {x:820,y:430},{x:930,y:200},{x:100,y:320},{x:980,y:560}\n];\n\n// Proyektil batu dilempar\nconst stones = [];\n\n/* ============================ MENU / DIALOG ============================ */\nconst overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');\nconst panel = document.getElementById('panel');\nconst panelTitle = document.getElementById('panel-title');\nconst panelContent = document.getElementById('panel-content');\nconst panelBtns = document.getElementById('panel-btns');\n\nfunction closeMenu(){ overlay.classList.remove('visible'); }\nfunction openMenu(title, contentHTML, buttonsHTML){\n  panelTitle.textContent = title;\n  panelContent.innerHTML = contentHTML;\n  panelBtns.innerHTML = buttonsHTML;\n  overlay.classList.add('visible');\n}\n\nfunction shopMenu(npc){\n  let html = `<p style=\"color:#ffd700;font-weight:bold;\">${npc.nama}</p><hr style=\"margin:8px 0;border-color:#555;\">`;\n  let btns = '';\n  const shop = npcStock(npc.profesi);\n  shop.forEach(it=>{\n    html += `<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#ddd;\">\n      <span>${it.name}</span>\n      <span style=\"color:#ffd700;\">Rp ${it.price.toLocaleString('id-ID')}</span>\n    </div>`;\n    btns += `<button class=\"primary\" onclick=\"buyItem('${it.id}',${it.price},'${it.name}')\">Beli ${it.name}</button>`;\n  });\n  if(fishCount>0 && npc.profesi!=='peralatan'){\n    html += `<div style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #555;padding-top:8px;color:#00bfff;\">Jual Ikan: ${fishCount} ekor &times; Rp 15.000</div>`;\n    btns += `<button class=\"primary\" onclick=\"sellFish(${npc.profesi==='makanan'?20000:15000})\">Jual Semua Ikan</button>`;\n  }\n  btns += `<button onclick=\"closeMenu()\">Tutup</button>`;\n  openMenu(`${npc.nama} - Toko`, html, btns);\n}\n\nfunction npcStock(profesi){\n  if(profesi==='makanan') return [\n    {id:'roti',name:'Roti',price:8000,effect:{energy:25}},\n    {id:'mie',name:'Mie Instan',price:6000,effect:{energy:20}},\n    {id:'nasi',name:'Nasi Goreng',price:12000,effect:{energy:40}}\n  ];\n  if(profesi==='minuman') return [\n    {id:'air',name:'Air Mineral',price:4000,effect:{energy:10}},\n    {id:'teh',name:'Teh Panas',price:5000,effect:{energy:15}},\n    {id:'kopi',name:'Kopi Gunung',price:9000,effect:{energy:30}}\n  ];\n  if(profesi==='peralatan') return [\n    {id:'tali',name:'Tali Pendak',price:25000,effect:{desc:'Alat pendak'}},\n    {id:'tenda',name:'Tenda Gunung',price:60000,effect:{desc:'Tenda untuk berkemah'}},\n    {id:'pancing',name:'Tongkat Pancing',price:35000,effect:{desc:'Alat memancing'}},\n    {id:'sepatu',name:'Sepatu Pendak',price:45000,effect:{desc:'Sepatu untuk mendaki tebing'}}\n  ];\n  return [];\n}\n\nwindow.buyItem = function(id,price,name){\n  if(money<price){ showMsg('Uang tidak cukup!'); return; }\n  if(inventory.length>=8){ showMsg('Tas penuh!'); return; }\n  money-=price; inventory.push(name); updateUI(); showMsg('Dibeli: '+name);\n  closeMenu();\n};\nwindow.sellFish = function(pricePer){\n  const total = fishCount*pricePer;\n  money+=total; fishCount=0; updateUI(); showMsg('Jual ikan: Rp '+total.toLocaleString('id-ID'));\n  closeMenu();\n};\n\nfunction restMenu(){\n  const html = `<p style=\"color:#ffd700;font-weight:bold;\">Rumah Istirahat</p>\n    <p style=\"color:#ddd;\">Istirahat akan memulihkan energi dan melewatkan waktu.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:#7cfc00;font-weight:bold;\">Energi: ${energy}% &rarr; 100%</p>`;\n  const btns = `<button class=\"primary\" onclick=\"doRest()\">Istirahat (Malam)</button>\n                <button onclick=\"closeMenu()\">Nanti</button>`;\n  openMenu('Rumah', html, btns);\n}\nwindow.doRest = function(){\n  energy = 100;\n  timeMinutes = 360; timeOfDay='Pagi';\n  updateUI(); closeMenu(); showMsg('Anda tertidur dan bangun pada pagi hari. Energi pulih!');\n};\n\nfunction talkMenu(npc){\n  const greetings = {\n    makanan:'Selamat datang! Kami jual makanan untuk teman-teman pendaki di sini.',\n    minuman:'Segarnya minuman gunung untuk melengkapi perjalanan Anda.',\n    peralatan:'Peralatan gunung lengkap: tali, tenda, tongkat pancing, dan sepatu pendak.',\n    pemandu:'Saya bisa memandu Anda mendaki tebing di sekitar danau ini.',\n    petani:'Sayur-segar dari ladang kami di kaki pegunungan.'\n  };\n  let html = `<p style=\"color:#ffd700;font-weight:bold;\">${npc.nama}</p>\n    <p style=\"color:#ddd;max-width:260px;line-height:1.5;\">${greetings[npc.profesi]||'Halo, sobat pendaki!'}</p>`;\n  let btns = '';\n  if(['makanan','minuman','peralatan'].includes(npc.profesi)){\n    html += `<hr style=\"margin:10px 0;border-color:#555;\"><p style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:12px;\">Lihat toko?</p>`;\n    btns += `<button class=\"primary\" onclick=\"shopMenu(${npcs.indexOf(npc)})\">Lihat Toko</button>`;\n  }\n  btns += `<button onclick=\"closeMenu()\">Tutup</button>`;\n  openMenu('Bicara', html, btns);\n}\n\n/* ============================ MINIGAME MEMANCING ============================ */\nlet fishing = false;\nlet fishTarget = null;\nlet fishProgress = 0;\nlet fishBarX = 200;\nlet fishZone = {x:0,w:120};\nlet fishSuccess = false;\n\nfunction startFishing(spot){\n  fishing = true; fishTarget = spot; fishProgress = 0;\n  fishBarX = 200; fishZone = {x: Math.random()*300+150, w: 90};\n  const html = `<p style=\"color:#00bfff;font-weight:bold;\">Memancing...</p>\n    <canvas id=\"fishCanvas\" width=\"420\" height=\"120\" style=\"border:2px solid #555;border-radius:8px;background:#111;display:block;margin:10px auto;\"></canvas>\n    <p style=\"color:#fff;font-size:13px;\">Tekan <b>SPASI</b> untuk menarik kail saat kail masuk zona hijau!</p>`;\n  const btns = `<button onclick=\"cancelFishing()\">Batal</button>`;\n  openMenu('Memancing', html, btns);\n  requestAnimationFrame(fishLoop);\n}\nfunction cancelFishing(){ fishing=false; closeMenu(); showMsg('Memancing dibatalkan.'); }\n\nfunction fishLoop(){\n  if(!fishing){ return; }\n  // gerakkan bar\n  const dir = fishSuccess?1:(fishBarX>fishZone.x+fishZone.w?-1:(fishBarX<fishZone.x?1:(Math.random()>0.5?1:-1)));\n  fishBarX += dir*2.6;\n  if(fishBarX<0) fishBarX=0;\n  if(fishBarX>420) fishBarX=420;\n\n  const fc = document.getElementById('fishCanvas');\n  const fx = fc.getContext('2d');\n  fx.clearRect(0,0,420,120);\n  // zona hijau\n  fx.fillStyle='rgba(46,204,113,0.35)'; fx.fillRect(fishZone.x,40,fishZone.w,40);\n  fx.strokeStyle='#2ecc71'; fx.lineWidth=2; fx.strokeRect(fishZone.x,40,fishZone.w,40);\n  // kail\n  fx.fillStyle='#f1c40f'; fx.beginPath(); fx.arc(fishBarX,60,7,0,Math.PI*2); fx.fill();\n  fx.strokeStyle='#b7950b'; fx.lineWidth=2; fx.stroke();\n\n  requestAnimationFrame(fishLoop);\n}\n\nwindow.handleFishSpace = function(){\n  if(!fishing) return;\n  const inside = fishBarX>=fishZone.x && fishBarX<=fishZone.x+fishZone.w;\n  if(inside){\n    fishProgress += 18;\n    if(fishProgress>=100){\n      fishing=false; closeMenu();\n      fishCount++; updateUI();\n      showMsg('Ikan ditangkap! Total ikan: '+fishCount);\n      // respawn ikan baru di mana saja\n      if(fishes.length<20) spawnFish();\n    } else {\n      showMsg('Ikan menggigit! Tekan spasi lagi.');\n    }\n  } else {\n    fishProgress = Math.max(0, fishProgress-8);\n    showMsg('Kail melewatkan zona, coba lagi!');\n  }\n};\n\n/* ============================ INPUT ============================ */\nconst keys = {};\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{\n  if(e.key==='Escape'){ closeMenu(); return; }\n  keys[e.key.toLowerCase()] = true;\n  if(overlay.classList.contains('visible')){\n    if(e.key===' ' && fishing) { e.preventDefault(); handleFishSpace(); }\n    return;\n  }\n  if(e.key.toLowerCase()==='e') interact();\n  if(e.key.toLowerCase()==='f') tryFishing();\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup', e=>{ keys[e.key.toLowerCase()] = false; });\ncanvas.addEventListener('mousedown', e=>{\n  if(overlay.classList.contains('visible')) return;\n  const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const sx = (e.clientX - rect.left) * (canvas.width / rect.width);\n  const sy = (e.clientY - rect.top) * (canvas.height / rect.height);\n  throwStone(sx+sy*0, sy); // x,y world approx\n}, {passive:false});\nfunction throwStone(wx, wy){\n  // arahkan ke posisi klik dari pemain\n  const dx = wx - (player.x - camera.x);\n  const dy = wy - (player.y - camera.y);\n  const dist = Math.hypot(dx,dy)||1;\n  stones.push({\n    x: player.x - camera.x + 15, y: player.y - camera.y + 15,\n    tx: wx, ty: wy,\n    vx: (dx/dist)*9, vy: (dy/dist)*9,\n    life: 60, r: 5\n  });\n  showMsg('Batu dilempar!');\n}\n\n/* ============================ INTERAKSI ============================ */\nfunction interact(){\n  const px = player.x, py = player.y;\n  // rumah\n  if(rectOverlap(px,py,player.w,player.h, house.x,house.y,house.w,house.h)){\n    restMenu(); return;\n  }\n  // npc\n  for(const n of npcs){\n    if(dist(px,py,n.x,n.y)<70){ talkMenu(n); return; }\n  }\n  // spot memancing\n  for(const s of fishingSpots){\n    if(dist(px,py,s.x,s.y)<60){ startFishing(s); return; }\n  }\n  // tumpukan batu\n  for(const p of stonePiles){\n    if(dist(px,py,p.x,p.y)<50){ showMsg('Tumpukan batu. Klik layar untuk melempar batu.'); return; }\n  }\n  showMsg('Tidak ada yang bisa diinteraksi di sini.');\n}\nfunction tryFishing(){\n  const px = player.x, py = player.y;\n  for(const s of fishingSpots){\n    if(dist(px,py,s.x,s.y)<70){ startFishing(s); return; }\n  }\n  showMsg('Pergi ke titik memancing di tepi danau.');\n}\n\n/* ============================ UPDATE ============================ */\nfunction update(){\n  if(overlay.classList.contains('visible') && !fishing) return;\n\n  // gerak pemain\n  let dx=0, dy=0;\n  if(keys['arrowup']||keys['w']) dy=-1;\n  if(keys['arrowdown']||keys['s']) dy=1;\n  if(keys['arrowleft']||keys['a']) dx=-1;\n  if(keys['arrowright']||keys['d']) dx=1;\n  if(dx!==0||dy!==0){\n    const len = Math.hypot(dx,dy);\n    player.x += (dx/len)*player.speed;\n    player.y += (dy/len)*player.speed;\n    player.dir = dx>0?'right':dx<0?'left':dy>0?'down':'up';\n    // batas dunia (ke dalam area pegunungan/danau)\n    player.x = Math.max(40, Math.min(W-40, player.x));\n    player.y = Math.max(40, Math.min(H-40, player.y));\n  }\n\n  // kamera ikuti pemain\n  camera.x = player.x - W/2;\n  camera.y = player.y - H/2;\n  camera.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(W, camera.x));\n  camera.y = Math.max(0, Math.min(H, camera.y));\n\n  // npc jalan\n  npcs.forEach(n=>{\n    n.x += n.vx; n.y += n.vy;\n    n.dir += 0.02;\n    if(n.x<150||n.x>W-150) n.vx*=-1;\n    if(n.y<150||n.y>H-150) n.vy*=-1;\n  });\n\n  // ikan berenang\n  fishes.forEach(f=>{\n    if(f.caught) return;\n    f.x += f.vx; f.y += f.vy;\n    const cx=280, cy=170;\n    const d = Math.hypot(f.x-cx, f.y-cy);\n    const rx=250, ry=150;\n    // elips boundary sederhana\n    const norm = (f.x-cx)/rx, normy=(f.y-cy)/ry;\n    if(norm*norm+normy*normy > 0.92){\n      f.vx *= -0.8; f.vy *= -0.8;\n      f.x += f.vx; f.y += f.vy;\n    }\n    if(Math.random()<0.02){ f.vx=(Math.random()-0.5)*1.2; f.vy=(Math.random()-0.5)*1.2; }\n  });\n\n  // batu terbang\n  stones.forEach((s,i)=>{\n    s.x += s.vx; s.y += s.vy; s.life--;\n    // tabrakan ikan (simulasi: batu jatuh ke danau)\n  });\n  stones.filter(s=>s.life>0);\n\n  // waktu berlalu perlahan\n  timeMinutes += 0.05;\n  if(timeMinutes>=1440) timeMinutes=360;\n  const h = Math.floor((timeMinutes/60)%24);\n  if(h<6||h>=18) timeOfDay='Malam';\n  else if(h<11) timeOfDay='Pagi';\n  else if(h<15) timeOfDay='Siang';\n  else timeOfDay='Sore';\n\n  updateUI();\n}\n\n/* ============================ RENDER ============================ */\nfunction rectOverlap(x1,y1,w1,h1, x2,y2,w2,h2){\n  return x1<x2+w2 && x1+w1>x2 && y1<y2+h2 && y1+h1>y2;\n}\nfunction dist(x1,y1,x2,y2){ return Math.hypot(x1-x2, y1-y2); }\n\nfunction drawWorld(){\n  // langit\n  const sky = timeOfDay==='Malam'?'#2c2c4a':(timeOfDay==='Sore'?'#ff9966':'#87ceeb');\n  ctx.fillStyle=sky; ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n  if(timeOfDay==='Malam'){\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff';\n    for(let i=0;i<40;i++){ ctx.fillRect(Math.random()*W, Math.random()*H*0.6, 1.5,1.5); }\n  }\n\n  // pegunungan di sekitar (belakang)\n  ctx.save(); ctx.translate(-camera.x*0.2, -camera.y*0.15);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.mtn1, 120, 40);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.mtn2, 560, 60);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.mtn3, 920, 30);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.snow, 380, -20);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.mtn2, 100, 300);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.mtn1, 820, 320);\n  ctx.restore();\n\n  // sungai (keluar dari danau ke kanan bawah)\n  ctx.save(); ctx.translate(-camera.x, -camera.y);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.river, 620, 420);\n  // aliran sungai 애니\n  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.5)'; ctx.lineWidth=2;\n  ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(660,460+Math.sin(Date.now()/200)*3); ctx.lineTo(760,500); ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.restore();\n\n  // danau di tengah\n  ctx.save(); ctx.translate(-camera.x, -camera.y);\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.lake, 280-280, 170-170);\n\n  // ikan\n  fishes.forEach(f=>{\n    if(f.caught) return;\n    ctx.fillStyle=f.color; ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(f.x, f.y, f.r, 0, Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.4)'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(f.x-3, f.y-2, 2.5,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n  });\n\n  // spot memancing\n  fishingSpots.forEach(s=>{\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#ffd700'; ctx.lineWidth=2; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(s.x,s.y,s.r,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff'; ctx.font='11px sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillText('🎣', s.x, s.y+4);\n  });\n\n  // tumpukan batu\n  stonePiles.forEach(p=>{\n    ctx.drawImage(IMG.stone, p.x-12, p.y-12);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff'; ctx.font='10px sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillText('🪨', p.x+2, p.y+2);\n  });\n\n  // rumah\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.house, house.x, house.y);\n  ctx.fillStyle='#fff'; ctx.font='13px bold sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center';\n  ctx.fillText('Rumah Istirahat', house.x+house.w/2, house.y-8);\n\n  // tenda\n  tents.forEach(t=>{ ctx.drawImage(IMG.tent, t.x, t.y); });\n\n  // batu dilempar\n  stones.forEach(s=>{\n    ctx.fillStyle='#95a5a6'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(s.x,s.y,s.r,0,Math.PI*2); ctx.fill();\n  });\n\n  // npc\n  npcs.forEach(n=>{\n    ctx.drawImage(n.img, n.x-14, n.y-14);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff'; ctx.font='11px sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.fillText(n.nama.split(' ')[0], n.x, n.y-18);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#aaa'; ctx.font='10px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText(n.profesi, n.x, n.y-6);\n  });\n\n  // pemain\n  ctx.drawImage(IMG.player, player.x-15, player.y-15);\n  ctx.fillStyle='#fff'; ctx.font='12px bold sans-serif'; ctx.textAlign='center';\n  ctx.fillText('Anda', player.x, player.y-20);\n\n  ctx.restore();\n\n  // petunjuk interaksi dekat\n  const near = getNearHint();\n  if(near){\n    const el=document.getElementById('hint');\n    el.textContent = near;\n    el.style.display='block';\n  } else {\n    document.getElementById('hint').style.display='none';\n  }\n}\n\nfunction getNearHint(){\n  const px=player.x, py=player.y;\n  for(const n of npcs) if(dist(px,py,n.x,n.y)<70) return `Bicara dengan ${n.nama} (E)`;\n  for(const s of fishingSpots) if(dist(px,py,s.x,s.y)<70) return `Tempat memancing (F)`;\n  if(rectOverlap(px,py,player.w,player.h, house.x,house.y,house.w,house.h)) return 'Masuk rumah / Istirahat (E)';\n  for(const p of stonePiles) if(dist(px,py,p.x,p.y)<50) return 'Tumpukan batu (klik untuk melempar)';\n  return null;\n}\n\nfunction loop(){\n  update();\n  drawWorld();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n}\n\nloop();\nupdateUI();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: game-gunung-danau.html"}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1793771301225,"ran":1793771301232,"completed":1793771301241}}],"snapshot":{"start":"f14eb5a0d4e5058bdfbd47d03b8a52cf6b9e1e3c","end":"264ec13a08eb3ce90f7f2bca9c9406c7dbe5692c","files":["game-gunung-danau.html"]},"finish":"tool-calls","rawFinish":"tool_calls","cost":0,"tokens":{"input":6580,"output":9795,"reasoning":707,"cache":{"read":0,"write":0}}},{"id":"msg_1a519e993001QEK1yIuJrVsgPW","time":{"created":1793771301270,"streamed":1793771306536,"completed":1793771306554},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"nemotron-3.5-super-vl-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"The file is created. Let me verify it by reading it back or just check it exists. Actually I wrote it fully. Let me do a quick sanity check that the file was created and maybe run a quick validation (no external server needed, it's just HTML). Let me confirm the file size / existence.\n\nActually, I noticed there's a bug in my code: `throwStone(sx+sy*0, sy)` — that passes x correctly as sx (since sy*0 = 0), y as sy. That's fine but weird. Let me clean it up mentally — it's fine functionally: `throwStone(sx, sy)` essentially.\n\nAlso `window.handleFishSpace` is called from keydown inside overlay — good.\n\nOne issue: in the keydown listener, when overlay is visible and fishing, pressing space calls handleFishSpace. But there's also `if(e.key.toLowerCase()==='e') interact();` — that's outside the overlay check, good.\n\nWait, let me re-check the keydown logic:\n\n```\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{\n  if(e.key==='Escape'){ closeMenu(); return; }\n  keys[e.key.toLowerCase()] = true;\n  if(overlay.classList.contains('visible')){\n    if(e.key===' ' && fishing) { e.preventDefault(); handleFishSpace(); }\n    return;\n  }\n  if(e.key.toLowerCase()==='e') interact();\n  if(e.key.toLowerCase()==='f') tryFishing();\n});\n```\n\nGood. When overlay visible and not fishing, pressing keys does nothing (return). Good.\n\nThe `shopMenu(${npcs.indexOf(npc)})` — npcs.indexOf(npc) works since n is the object reference. Good.\n\nEverything looks reasonable. Let me verify the file exists and is non-empty.","native":{"reasoningField":"reasoning_content"},"time":{"created":1793771302708,"completed":1793771306532}},{"type":"text","text":"File berhasil dibuat. Mari saya verifikasi bahwa file tersebut valid dan lengkap.\n"},{"type":"tool","id":"call-76f26207-dba4-4c51-8a5d-13e60e3b343d","name":"shell","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la /home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/game-gunung-danau.html && wc -l /home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/game-gunung-danau.html"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"-rw-r--r-- 1 runner runner 26708 Nov  4 05:48 /home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/game-gunung-danau.html\n698 /home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/game-gunung-danau.html\n"}],"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0}},"time":{"created":1793771306526,"ran":1793771306534,"completed":1793771306549}}],"snapshot":{"start":"264ec13a08eb3ce90f7f2bca9c9406c7dbe5692c","end":"264ec13a08eb3ce90f7f2bca9c9